---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Washtenaw County Expungement Attorney - Joseph A. Simon';
const description =
  'Named a Top Ten Criminal Defense Attorney in Michigan by Leading Lawyers Magazine, Attorney Joe Simon Has Successfully Obtained Expungements for Over 35 Years.';

const charges = [
  'Expungement Attorney',
  'Expunge Criminal History',
  'Misdemeanor Expungement',
  'Felony Expungement',
  'Expungement of Arrest Records',
  'Expunge Criminal Conviction',
];

const introImage = 'https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ee60f2da/images/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa38d_criminal2-e740bd-1536.webp';
const sideImage1 = 'https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ee60f2da/images/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa3a4_criminal6-665e08-1536.webp';
const sideImage2 = 'https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ee60f2da/images/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa3b1_criminal9-96492d-1536.webp';
---

<BaseLayout headerVariant="transparent" title={title} description={description}>
  <main data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:ddr7xh">
    <section class="practice-hero" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:y2o21k">
      <div class="practice-container" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:b1zpsd">
        <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:97lxgu">
          <a href="/" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pjm">Home</a><span data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tup1w8">/</span><a href="/practice-areas" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pjn">Practice Areas</a><span data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tup1w7">/</span><span data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tup1w6">Expungements</span>
        </nav>
        <div class="eyebrow" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:b1zpsc">Expungements</div>
        <h1 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:a97nw5">Washtenaw County Expungement Attorney - Joseph A. Simon</h1>
        <p class="hero-intro" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp758">Washtenaw Defense Lawyer - Restore Your Reputation. We've Obtained Expungements For Clients For Over 38 Years. Local, Experienced, Established.</p>
        <p class="hero-description" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp757">Named a Top Ten Criminal Defense Attorney in Michigan by Leading Lawyers Magazine, Attorney Joe Simon Has Successfully Obtained Expungements for Over 35 Years.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhytw">
          <a class="button" href="/#contact" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pjo">Request a Confidential Consultation</a>
          <a class="phone" href="tel:+17348876200" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pjp">(734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="practice-body practice-container" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhytx">
      <div class="reading-column" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhyty">
        <h2 class="intro-heading" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:oxml3s">See Video For New Expungement Laws | Expungements Can Clear Your Record Of Past Criminal Arrests, Charges, And Convictions In Michigan.</h2>

        <img class="main-image" src={introImage} alt="" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:dk8u4o" />

        <article class="source-copy" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:ywj03r">
          <h3 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:vf2jn1"><a href="/practice-area/owi-dui-expungements" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pjq">For over 38 years, we have successfully petitioned to remove and expunge past criminal convictions and helped persons gain a fresh start for their futures. For the first time in history, Michigan now allows expungements for first-time Drunk Driving charges.</a></h3>

          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp74l">A criminal record can prevent job and housing opportunities, student loan approval, acceptance to schools and universities, and more. In many cases, a court can set aside a criminal conviction, or “expunge” it. If granted, the previous conviction is set aside, removed from public record, and a person may honestly say they have not been convicted of a crime. Getting a conviction expunged can be a complex process. For example, most convictions require a mandatory waiting period before the application can be filed, usually 3-7 years after your last day of probation, or discharge from parole. However, there are some offenses that have no waiting period whatsoever. Let our office can guide you through the process.</p>

          <h3 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:vf2jn2">I Have a Felony Conviction in Washtenaw County and a Misdemeanor Conviction in Chelsea, MI. Can I still Get an Expungement?</h3>

          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp74k">It depends. Expungements have certain eligibility requirements in Michigan. There are lifetime limits of three felonies and two assaultive crimes but multiple convictions based on offenses committed within 24 hours of each other may be treated as a single offense.</p>

          <h3 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:vf2jno">I Have a Drunk Driving (DUI/OWI) Conviction from Ann Arbor, MI. Can I Get That Conviction Expunged?</h3>

          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp74j">Yes! for the firs time in the State of Michigan, a first offense drinking and driving conviction can be expunged from your criminal record. The new law becomes effective February 19, 2022 but there are things you can do now to get ready to petition the court. <a href="/practice-area/owi-dui-expungements" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pjr">Click here</a> for more information and contact us today to determine your eligibilty.</p>

          <h3 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:vf2jnp">I Have a Conviction in Washtenaw County, MI But Now Live Out of State. Do I Have to Appear in Michigan to Get an Expungement?</h3>

          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp74i">No. Applications for expungements must be filed in the court in which the conviction(s) originated. However, an attorney can often appear on behalf of a client who has relocated and remote court appearances can also often be accomplished by video conference.</p>

          <h3 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:vf2jnq">Does an expungement really eliminate <em>all record</em> of my conviction?</h3>

          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp74h">No. An order setting aside a criminal conviction creates a non-public record that can only be accessed by certain government agencies for particular purposes such as a law enforcement considering a person for employment or a court sentencing someone for a felony. Additionally, setting aside any traffic offense expunges the criminal record but it does not remove the offense from the Secretary of State’s driving records. Contact us for a complete list of these exceptions</p>

          <h3 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:vf2jnr">I heard these convictions are going to be set aside automatically. Is that true?</h3>

          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp74g">No. Michigan's Clean Slate legislation that went into effect in April 2023, expempts OWI convictions. These conviction still require the filing of an application.</p>

          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp74f">For over 38 years, Joseph A. Simon has successfully petitioned to remove and expunge past criminal convictions and helped persons gain a fresh start. If you or a loved one desire to expunge a conviction that arose in Washtenaw, Wayne, Jackson, Livingston, or Lenawee County, contact us at 734-887-6200 to see why so many people have chosen The Law Offices of Joseph A. Simon to restore and protect their freedom and reputation.</p>
        </article>

        <div class="video" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhytz">
          <iframe
            src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/504082522"
            title="Expungement Video"
            loading="lazy"
            allow="fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="practice-sidebar" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:j1ery2">
        <section class="sidebar-card charges" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:y2o21l">
          <h2 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:oxml3r">We Defend These Charges:</h2>
          <ul>
            {charges.map((charge) => <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:o6nonr">{charge}</li>)}
          </ul>
        </section>

        <img class="sidebar-image" src={sideImage1} alt="" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:dk8u4n" />
        <img class="sidebar-image" src={sideImage2} alt="" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:dk8u41" />

        <a class="all-practices" href="/practice-areas" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pjs">Explore All Practice Areas <span aria-hidden="true" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tup1w5">→</span></a>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-[#061633] py-[100px]" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:y2o21m">
      <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 text-center" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhyu0">
        <div class="mb-4" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhyu1">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.8px] text-[#C9A840]" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tup1w4"><span class="w-[28px] h-[2px] bg-[#C9A840] inline-block mr-3" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tup1w3"></span>Consultation</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-[44px] font-black leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.53px] text-white mb-6 max-w-[820px] mx-auto" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:oxml3q">Whatever the charge, talk to us first.</h2>
        <p class="text-[18.08px] leading-[31px] text-[#C3CCDA] max-w-[680px] mx-auto mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3rp74e">Your consultation is confidential and available 24/7. Tell us what you're facing and we'll explain how Michigan law applies to it.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-12" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhyu2">
          <a href="/#contact" class="bg-[#732521] text-white font-semibold text-[16.16px] px-[30px] py-[16px] rounded-[3px] hover:bg-[#5a1c19] transition inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pke">Request a Confidential Consultation<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
          <a href="tel:+17348876200" class="border border-white/30 text-white font-semibold text-[16.16px] px-[30px] py-[16px] rounded-[3px] hover:border-[#C9A840] hover:text-[#DDC582] transition inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:3c8pkf">Call (734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8 mt-8" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhyu3">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhyu4">
            <a href="/" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:mszv62">Home</a>
            <a href="/practice-areas" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:mszv61">Practice Areas</a>
            <a href="/#results" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:mszv60">Results</a>
            <a href="/#about" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:mszv5z">About</a>
            <a href="/#testimonials" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:mszv5y">Testimonials</a>
            <a href="/#faq" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:mszv5x">FAQs</a>
            <a href="/#contact" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:mszv5w">Contact</a>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:tfhyu5">
            <a href="tel:+17348876200" class="text-[#C9A840] font-bold text-[16px] hover:text-[#DDC582] transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/expungements.astro:mszv5v">Call (734) 887-6200</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .practice-container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
  }

  /* Hero: court image with the source gradient overlay */
  .practice-hero {
    color: #fff;
    padding: 140px 0 88px;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(4, 16, 38, 0.97), rgba(8, 26, 60, 0.85)),
      url("https://jas-law-astro-review.netlify.app/hero-court-1.webp");
    background-size: auto, cover;
    background-position: 0% 0%, 50% 50%;
  }

  .breadcrumbs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #c3ccda;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .breadcrumbs a:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }
  .breadcrumbs span:last-child {
    color: #ddc582;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c9a840;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    width: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #c9a840;
  }

  .practice-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 1.4rem + 2.8vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    color: #fff;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #ddc582;
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #c3ccda;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 0 36px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .hero-actions .button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #732521;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .hero-actions .button:hover {
    background: #581b19;
  }

  .hero-actions .phone {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c9a840;
  }
  .hero-actions .phone:hover {
    color: #ddc582;
  }

  /* Body: reading column + sidebar */
  .practice-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 800px) minmax(0, 300px);
    gap: 72px;
    padding-top: 64px;
    padding-bottom: 90px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .reading-column {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .intro-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.22;
    color: #061532;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  .main-image,
  .sidebar-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .main-image {
    aspect-ratio: 800 / 380;
  }

  .sidebar-image {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
  }

  .source-copy {
    margin-top: 36px;
    color: #141c28;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .source-copy h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: #061532;
    margin: 36px 0 12px;
  }

  .source-copy h3:first-child {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-top: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .source-copy h3 a {
    color: #732321;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .source-copy h3 a:hover {
    color: #581b19;
  }

  .source-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .source-copy a {
    color: #732321;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .source-copy em {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .video {
    margin-top: 40px;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
  }
  .video iframe {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .practice-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    background: #f7f6f2;
    border: 1px solid #e7e3d9;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px 22px;
  }

  .sidebar-card h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #732321;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .sidebar-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .sidebar-card li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 22px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #454e5e;
  }
  .sidebar-card li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #c9a840;
  }

  .all-practices {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #732321;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .all-practices:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .practice-body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .practice-sidebar {
      max-width: 420px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .practice-hero {
      padding: 112px 0 64px;
    }
    .hero-intro {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .intro-heading {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    .source-copy {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .source-copy h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-actions .button {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
